# Cubietech Cubieboard (`cubieboard`)

The `cubieboard` model emulates the Cubietech Cubieboard, which is a Cortex-A8 based single-board computer using the AllWinner A10 SoC.

## Emulated devices

- Timer
- UART
- RTC
- EMAC
- SDHCI
- USB controller
- SATA controller
- TWI (I2C) controller
- SPI controller
- Watchdog timer
ENDOFFILE)
