# Xilinx ZynqMP ZCU102 (`xlnx-zcu102`)

The `xlnx-zcu102` board models the Xilinx ZynqMP ZCU102 board. This board has 4 Cortex-A53 CPUs and 2 Cortex-R5F CPUs.

## Machine-specific options

- `secure` - Set `on`/`off` to enable/disable Arm Security Extensions (TrustZone). Default: `off`.
- `virtualization` - Set `on`/`off` to enable/disable Arm Virtualization Extensions. Default: `off`.
