# M68K System Emulator

QEMU M68K system emulator for ColdFire and M68K processors.

## Supported Machines

### MCF5208

- ColdFire MCF5208 processor
- Internal SRAM and peripherals
- UART, timer, interrupt controller

### MCF5206

- ColdFire MCF5206 processor
- Similar peripheral set to MCF5208

## Usage

```
qemu-system-m68k -machine mcf5208evb -kernel image.elf
```
