# QEMU Storage Daemon QMP Reference

> Source: `docs/interop/qemu-storage-daemon-qmp-ref.rst`

## Overview

This is an auto-generated reference document. The actual content is generated from the QAPI schema file at `storage-daemon/qapi/qapi-schema.json` during the QEMU build process.

The QEMU Storage Daemon (`qemu-storage-daemon`) provides a standalone QMP interface for storage operations without running a full VM, including block device management, export protocols (NBD, FUSE, VDUSE), snapshot/backup operations, and job management.

## Schema Location

- Source schema: `storage-daemon/qapi/qapi-schema.json`
