# PowerPC System Emulator

QEMU PowerPC system emulator supporting a wide range of boards from embedded to server-class systems.

## Supported Machines

### Embedded Boards

- **40p**: IBM PowerPC 40p evaluation board
- **bamboo**: IBM Bamboo evaluation board (440EP)
- **mpc8544ds**: MPC8544DS evaluation board
- **virtex-ml507**: Xilinx Virtex ML507 with PPC440

### PowerNV (Power Non-Virtualized)

- Server-class POWER processors
- POWER8, POWER9, POWER10 support
- Full system emulation with virtual hostbridge

### PowerMac

- **mac99**: PowerMac G4 (Mac OS 9, Mac OS X, Linux)
- **g3beige**: PowerMac G3 Beige
- Old World and New World ROM support

### pSeries

- IBM pSeries logical partition
- Virtual I/O server support
- PCI passthrough

### Sam460ex

- AMCC Sam460ex evaluation board
- 460EX processor

## Usage

```
qemu-system-ppc -machine mac99 -kernel vmlinux
qemu-system-ppc64 -machine powernv -kernel zImage
```
ENDOFFILE)
