# SPARC64 System Emulator

QEMU 64-bit SPARC (SPARC V9) system emulator.

## Supported Machines

### sun4u

- Sun4u architecture (UltraSPARC)
- Compatible with Solaris and Linux

### sun4v

- Sun4v architecture (Niagara)
- Logical domain support
- UltraSPARC T1/T2 processors

### Niagara

- Sun Niagara processor emulation
- Hardware strand support

### Peripherals

- **IOMMU**: Sun IOMMU
- **PCI**: PCI bus with various devices
- **e1000**: Intel Gigabit Ethernet
- **IDE**: IDE controller
- **VGA**: VGA display
- **SABRE**: PCI host bridge

## Supported Processors

- **UltraSPARC II**: Sun UltraSPARC II
- **UltraSPARC III**: Sun UltraSPARC III (Cu)
- **UltraSPARC IIIi**: UltraSPARC IIIi (Jalapeno)
- **UltraSPARC T1**: Niagara

## Usage

```
qemu-system-sparc64 -machine sun4u -m 2G -kernel zImage
qemu-system-sparc64 -machine niagara -m 4G
```
ENDOFFILE)
